-- Finding 26: s 18BD(4), the Commission must decide on long-term care "prior to the expiry of the period in subsection (3)". READING:
-- by the day before the day interim benefits cease. The adult claiming on 1 April 2025: ceases 1 April 2028, so by 31 March 2028. The
