§§ `Regulative rules -- traces (clock: days)`

-- s 7(3): claim interstate on day 10, notice the same day, $20,000 repaid from the $50,000 award on day 400.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 7(3) -- a claimant who claims in the other jurisdiction must tell the Commission at once, and repay benefits from what is awarded` 20000 50000) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the claimant` `claim damages or compensation under the law of the place of the accident` 10), (EVENT `the claimant` `give the Commission written notice of the claim` 10), (EVENT `the claimant` (`reimburse the Commission` 20000) 400)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- No benefits paid yet: notice alone fulfils it.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 7(3) -- a claimant who claims in the other jurisdiction must tell the Commission at once, and repay benefits from what is awarded` 0 50000) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the claimant` `claim damages or compensation under the law of the place of the accident` 10), (EVENT `the claimant` `give the Commission written notice of the claim` 10)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the claimant, "s 7(3)(a): ..." (notice given the next day, not "immediately")
